{"version":1,"key":"card:592","content":{"id":592,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b1f8b424-1740-4569-b2da-10245206183f","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Transfer-Encoding"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 指定了网络节点之间传输消息时的编码方式，取值有："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"d493810c-4290-4507-bd5a-84c5837ef399","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"e81ed2ec-448d-4d38-9607-f55300f4a193","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"578dbfdf-afc7-4be1-a2cd-26e9f4002fa1","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"chunked"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"a9f77e38-d39c-492b-9ad8-9c197d47fe69","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1a051b7d-6192-4113-917c-d32e29483521","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"gzip"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"c120bbd2-9194-43e6-871a-6b76bc085390","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"580e9bd1-232d-4de3-b2a7-3e5156aed4dd","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"compress"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"ffb7febb-78e3-4e93-9ff2-4895268f3379","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"aba34668-ee0a-4f28-92f6-131f76ce0161","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"deflate"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2547c10f-f7aa-4d9c-8dfe-7ab61ef15656","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"最常见的取值是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"chunked"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，表示分块传输，常用于动态生成内容，不知道内容长度的时候，或者在对实时性能要求较高时，分块传输可以边生成边发送数据，提升用户体验。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f7383c62-de3a-421f-ab49-2b39e092bb28","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"其他取值表示在传输消息的压缩方式（不常用），可以和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"chunked"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 结合使用，表示压缩后对分块进行传输。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"HTTP","uuid":"3d4dce47-b62b-44c4-be86-9d9f26f7f328","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"94d473af-1b65-43ef-9a09-fc8d61670e54","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"Transfer-Encoding: gzip, chunked","collabId":"6fd4e366-bdfe-4f22-bc61-c4e551b091af","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"61670be4-9766-4662-bc0e-6c0d0516dffe","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上述就表示进行 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"gzip"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 压缩后进行分块传输。"}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"tip","title":"概念辨析","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"4ce2f38b-e1d2-4b9c-be8c-e97bb5f96acc","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3d061a56-df45-40c4-9b9f-54e6fb9f7821","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Content-Encoding"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 也可以指定压缩方式，和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Transfer-Encoding"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的区别是什么？"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9d8171a7-0c1d-4670-a443-eb2e59dda6b5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为了解释清楚，首先分清楚两种头部，逐跳头（Hop-by-Hop Headers）和端到端头（End-to-End Headers）。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0346b10d-e391-4f96-ad04-1998600490c9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"正常情况下客户端不是直接和服务器连接，中间存在许多代理，比如缓存代理，网关代理，我们统称为网络节点好了，实际的传输会经过多个网络节点，所谓的逐跳头表示在这些网络节点传输过程中可能被网络节点处理后移除或修改的头部，因此逐跳头只对当前传输有效，与之对应的端到端头表示从客户端到服务器（或者反过来）中间网络节点不可以修改或删除的头，由客户端或服务器直接处理，中间的网络节点进行盲转发。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"22f5757e-f811-4cfd-ba9d-659a407cce50","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Transfer-Encoding"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是逐跳头，这说明它只在这次网络传输有效，代理服务器完全可以在接受服务器的分块传输并完成合并后，将完整的请求返回给客户端，并且将 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Transfer-Encoding"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 头删除："}]},{"type":"mermaid","tauContract":"1c918d7603a3e3ecd29f011e4bab52bce848fe941bcb9a9dcf18f1024e918a5d","chart":"sequenceDiagram\n    participant Client as 客户端\n    participant Proxy as 代理服务器\n    participant Server as 服务器\n\n    Note over Server: 服务器处理流程\n    Server->>Server: 生成动态数据（未确定大小）\n    Server->>Server: 将数据分块编码（chunked）\n    Server->>Server: 添加头部<br/>Transfer-Encoding: chunked\n    Server->>Proxy: 发送分块数据<br/>（Headers + Chunks）\n\n    Note over Proxy: 代理处理流程\n    Proxy->>Proxy: 接收分块数据\n    Proxy->>Proxy: 解分块 → 合并完整数据\n    Proxy->>Proxy: 移除逐跳头部（Transfer-Encoding）<br/>添加 Content-Length\n    Proxy->>Client: 转发完整数据<br/>（Headers + Body）\n\n    Note over Client: 客户端处理\n    Client->>Client: 接收完整数据<br/>（自动解析 Content-Length）","collabId":"662c1385-368f-4d1a-ab34-fa4a0dbcf94c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2be6f170-388a-4900-9d8d-7aa8732d658d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"而 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Content-Encoding"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是端到端头，中间的网络节点不能修改和删除，由客户端和服务器直接处理。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7254e745-8f36-4a1e-ad13-63be5c3e597d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所以从这里可以看出，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Transfer-Encoding"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 指定的是网络节点之间的传输方式，代理可以根据当前网络环境修改数据的传输方式（分块还是完整传输），而 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Content-Encoding"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 指定的是客户端和服务器之间的编码方式，代理是不能修改的。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9a22c8f0-4c4a-4c03-8419-311c88a50dfc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在实际使用的时候，如果需要压缩，不会使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Transfer-Encoding"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来在传输的时候压缩，因为它是逐跳的，可以被删除掉，在后续的流程中可能传输的就不是压缩的数据，造成带宽上升，为了保证传输的始终是压缩的数据，我们应该使用端对端头 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Content-Encoding"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来表示压缩，中间的网络节点只负责数据的传输，而对压缩不感兴趣，如果需要采用分块传输，则通过"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Transfer-Encoding"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来实现，即使中间的网络节点传输方式不同，但是传输的依旧是压缩后的数据。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f033fe25-3989-4a1d-b210-34ada782457b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所以常见的用法应该如下"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"HTTP","uuid":"a7e30ab6-4c78-403e-85c7-3856787f8477","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"505e3a7d-f4c8-45fd-9105-14043fe9db21","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"Transfer-Encoding: chunked\nContent-Encoding: gzip","collabId":"2b7e8d51-4de6-4a38-b318-ebe02d8bfb2f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"bd19f11d-19e6-4cfd-b996-f1c4de96b842","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"chunked"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 进行分块传输，块的格式为"},{"type":"styled-text","color":"gray","tauContract":"d18485913856addbefa2ced1511da60261ef67fcb40faff6190f86232aa01390","collabId":"b389671b-98d0-4ede-ba4c-ea55e1fb185b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"块大小 + 数据"}]}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"0a910049-804e-4bc3-bf72-1452204499fb","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"b529e257-cfed-4bd8-a322-cd98ec7798ec","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"523725b7-a995-416d-a884-f6839052547a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"块大小，使用十六进制表示，格式为"},{"type":"styled-text","color":"gray","tauContract":"d18485913856addbefa2ced1511da60261ef67fcb40faff6190f86232aa01390","collabId":"5a2a6f96-6c1f-4d47-8686-8f96bee4e6ca","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"块大小\\r\\n"}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"af533eb1-0533-4f46-a3a5-08b7ff53c97d","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0b802376-e874-4aaf-85b0-bbd9c36ba34c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"数据，长度为块大小指定的字节数，格式为"},{"type":"styled-text","color":"gray","tauContract":"d18485913856addbefa2ced1511da60261ef67fcb40faff6190f86232aa01390","collabId":"312b12a7-5a8a-422c-8283-00148e4fafcd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"数据\\r\\n"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c3f50cf1-9c9e-4908-8c37-e5ba7657ff8a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"最后以一个大小为 0 的块结束 "},{"type":"styled-text","color":"gray","tauContract":"d18485913856addbefa2ced1511da60261ef67fcb40faff6190f86232aa01390","collabId":"fd8f74bd-f847-4c75-946b-b826b14069ea","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"0\\r\\n\\r\\n"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4bf497e7-ead7-4c94-96ba-7feb50590c74","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"看一个实际的例子，在未设置 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Content-Length"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的情况下，通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"res.write"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 就可以发送 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Transfer-Encoding: chunked"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的数据"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"2e8558d0-cae4-4881-8493-2520d7ac40d8","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"c7533f59-e73b-4503-bcbb-d0889fec8af0","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const express = require('express');\n\nconst sleep = (ms) => new Promise(resolve => setTimeout(resolve, ms));\n\nconst app = express();\n\napp.get('/chunked', async (req, res) => {\n  res.write('Hello');\n  await sleep(1000);\n  res.write('World');\n  await sleep(1000);\n  res.write('Bye');\n  res.end();\n})\n\napp.listen(3000, () => {\n  console.log('Server is running on port 3000');\n})","collabId":"53ca7a4f-3dc4-4512-953d-a392f3233ba6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fd0c0a97-ab8e-4a54-abde-2a13469d1100","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"curl http://localhost:3000/chunked --raw "},{"type":"formatted","text":"查看响应"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"HTTP","uuid":"483bf191-b389-49de-9b6a-7e15adf647bb","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"0745bf36-15ad-4890-a372-7dbe0109d8f2","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"5\nHello\n5\nWorld\n3\nBye\n0\n","collabId":"0f13397d-604f-4bcf-8b0f-3bfaf1747f38","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["HTTP/Transfer-Encoding"],"createTime":1752462780314,"updateTime":1775053297940,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1775053297940}}